  aa-manifest                              |
  aa-keyAlgorithm                          |
  aa-userCertificate                       |
  aa-keyPackageReceivers-v2                |
  aa-tsecNomenclature                      |
  aa-keyPurpose                            |
  aa-keyUse                                |
  aa-transportKey                          |
  aa-keyDistributionPeriod                 |
  aa-keyValidityPeriod                     |
  aa-keyDurationPeriod                     |
  aa-classificationAttribute               |
